   "what_you_did": "Larry waits at the hotel with a charged camera.",
   "what_you_said": "",
   "your_intention": "I am not going to waste the last charge on a closing theater or a rehearsal. I am going to keep the camera powered and secure. I will wait in the lobby with the crew, drink the coffee, and listen to the van backfire. I will not move toward the Rialto. I will not move toward the ballroom. I will stay here, in the neutral space of the hotel, holding the battery for whatever comes next, if anything comes. I am refusing the spectacle. I am choosing the idle state."
